  "id": "getRestaurantMenu",
  "label": "Read restaurant menu",
  "description": "Reads public server-rendered restaurant categories and items with source IDs and displayed prices. Does not select options or change a cart. Missing categories and bounded output are explicitly incomplete; prices are not checkout quotes.",
